1. What is DINGG?

DINGG official website

DINGG is an all-in-one cloud-based salon/spa management platform. It is much bigger than a simple appointment-booking application.

Its main concept is:

Book → Bill → Manage → Market

DINGG combines appointments, customers, staff, billing/POS, inventory, marketing, memberships and reporting in one system.

