16. So should you use DINGG?

For a real salon owner, DINGG can be a very strong ready-made solution because it covers the entire operation rather than just one function. Its published feature set includes booking, CRM, POS, inventory, marketing, loyalty, staff management, reporting and multi-location management.

But there is an important distinction.

If your objective is:

"I want to operate my beauty parlour."

➡️ DINGG is worth evaluating.

If your objective is:

"I want to build AI solutions and earn money from AI projects."

➡️ Don't simply replace your project with DINGG.

Your project teaches you how to build the technology yourself.

