18. One important business opportunity

DINGG is a general-purpose salon platform.

You don't necessarily need to compete with it feature-for-feature.

Instead, you could build a much narrower product:

"AI Receptionist for Beauty Parlours"

For example:

Customer calls → AI answers → understands service → checks availability → books appointment → sends WhatsApp confirmation → stores customer → asks for feedback after visit.

That is much easier to sell initially than trying to build an entire DINGG competitor.

Your architecture could be:
Customer
