   Reports / Analytics

My assessment: DINGG is a very useful benchmark for your project. Instead of trying to copy all of DINGG immediately, 
I would use it to identify the highest-value AI feature you can build and sell separately—especially an AI receptionist + booking + WhatsApp + feedback workflow.

Also, DINGG does not publicly list a straightforward standard price on its current India pages; pricing appears to be handled through a demo/contact process, 
so I would get a direct quote before comparing its cost with building your own system.

